  "body": "## What changed\n\nClip each pick-outline segment before screen projection.\nKeep each visible edge portion and preserve outline adjacency.\nSelected, viewport-hover and row-hover highlights share this path.\n\n## Cause\n\nThe old code projected points separately.\nIt dropped points behind the eye and lost visible edge portions.\nPoints before the near plane could project far outside the viewport.\nThe baseline is upstream/main `08697d3c4`.\n\n## Tests\n\nPins:\n\n- `pick_highlight_mesh::tests::highlight_near_clip_keeps_every_rectangle_edge_without_a_bridge`\n- `pick_highlight_mesh::tests::highlight_near_clip_mesh_stays_within_the_rectangle_stroke`\n- `pick_highlight_mesh::tests::highlight_near_clip_stops_a_front_of_eye_point_before_projection`\n- `pick_highlight_mesh::tests::highlight_near_clip_does_not_join_disconnected_visible_runs`\n- `pick_highlight_mesh::tests::highlight_near_clip_preserves_a_fully_visible_closed_outline`\n- `pick_highlight_mesh::tests::highlight_near_clip_nonfinite_corner_does_not_connect_its_neighbors`\n- `pick_highlight_mesh::tests::highlight_near_clip_keeps_a_segment_crossing_the_positive_w_boundary`\n\nOn unchanged code, five pins fail and two pass.\nWith the fix, all seven pins pass.\nRestoring the old code makes five pins fail; the two invariant pins still pass.\nRestoring the fix makes all seven pins pass.\nRemoving the near-plane guard makes its pin fail. Restoring the guard makes it pass.\nRemoving the positive-w guard makes its pin fail. Restoring the guard makes it pass.\n\n`cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main` passes: 1,339 tests pass and seven are ignored.\n`cargo clippy -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -- -D warnings` exits with code 0.\nThe heavy gate plan reaches no lane.\n\n## Goldens moved\n\nNone.\n\n## Not exercised\n\nNo manual GPU or desktop visual check ran.\nThe snapshot and release lanes did not run.\n\n## Overlaps\n\nNone. The overlap check used a limit of 200 open PRs.\n\nChangelog: Clip selected and hover pick outlines at the near plane before screen projection.\n\nEffort: medium\n\nFixes #3024\n",
